{"id":"52e708105e8ce779","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-untyped-truth.md","title":"无类型真理","display":"df-untyped-truth — 无类型真理","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-untyped-truth","aliases":["91-df-untyped-truth"],"display":"df-untyped-truth — 无类型真理","depends_on":["[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-untyped-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-untyped-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-untyped-truth — 无类型真理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-untyped-truth-—-无类型真理-$\\mathrm{Untyped\\text{-}Truth}$\">df-untyped-truth — 无类型真理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Untyped\\text{-}Truth}\">\\(\\mathrm{Untyped\\text{-}Truth}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span> (带真理谓词的语言, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (一元真理谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}^1\">\\(\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}^1\\)</span> (一元谓词符号集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>\n(句子的 Gödel 编码)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline n\">\\(\\overline n\\)</span> (自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的对象语言数字, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}untyped\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Untyped\\text{-}Truth}(T,\\mathcal L_T)\n\\coloneqq\nT\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T}^{1}\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\Bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}untyped\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Untyped\\text{-}Truth}(T,\\mathcal L_T)\n\\coloneqq\nT\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T}^{1}\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\Bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Untyped\\text{-}Truth}\">\\(\\mathrm{Untyped\\text{-}Truth}\\)</span> : 无类型真理（统一真理理论）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}\\)</span> : 扩展语言句子集（含真理谓词的句子）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：无类型（type-free）只规定同一个谓词<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>可以形成关于任意<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span>句子编码的原子式，包括含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>的句子。该句法性质本身不推出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\">\\(T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\)</span>；对整个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span>加入全部双条件式会因对角句而不一致，具体真理原则必须由KF、FS等理论分别给出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-untyped-truth-—-无类型真理-$\\mathrm{Untyped\\text{-}Truth}$","text":"df-untyped-truth — 无类型真理 $\\mathrm{Untyped\\text{-}Truth}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{L}_T$ (带真理谓词的语言, see [[91-df-language-with-truth]])","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ (一元真理谓词, see [[91-df-language-with-truth]])","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":